# Dependencies and security

After adding or upgrading dependencies:

- Run `pnpm audit --audit-level=high` and fix high/critical findings.
- Never pin to a known vulnerable range.
- Every `pnpm.overrides` entry needs a documented reason in [`md/security.md`](../../md/security.md); remove once upstream fixes the transitive.
- Search `@default/utils` and existing packages before adding a new dependency.
